==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Capy]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*2 [[Tarsiriel]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>.
*7 [[Diabrollow]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Techn-Old Hyena]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>.
*3 [[Capy|Capies]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 43.33~53.33 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Manic Mohawk Cat]], [[Mohawk Cat]], [[Manic Eraser Cat]] and [[Boulder Cat]] will do the meatshielding in this stage.

Here, your attackers don't die that easily, but your army is pushed thanks to the synergy of the following 3 enemies: Techn-Old Hyena's warp ability, Tarsiriel's slow ability, which already ensures that little by little they are stepping into your territory, now including and Diabrollow's pushing gimmick, [[Mini-Wave]] + [[Knockback]], it seems like there's no way to create balance out of that. However, Techn-Old Hyena helps you to counter the Diabrollows; since [[Octopus Cat]] can survive the Hyena's attack at least 3 times, it will keep being warped, creating a big blockade of [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Shields]] to at least ensure that Diabrollow's attack won't reach to its full extent! Let's not forget about Tarsiriel, who will make sure your Octopus Cats stay far enough not to be in the range of Capy. Same goes for Manic Erasers, though they will be not very useful if hit by the Tarsiriel.

And now that out of the way, you will add the usual counters for each enemy—[[Courier Cat]] for Capy and any long-ranged attacker, preferably [[Li'l King Dragon Cat]] with the Mini-Wave and Survive Talents, for Techn-Old Hyena.

Additional units that can assist you are: [[Neo Cutter Cat]], [[Can Can Cat]], and [[Jelly Dumpling Cat]]!

Additionally, you can also cheese this stage quite easily; simply rush down the first capy with your damage dealers & send in [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahablast]] when there's a good enough stack of meatsheilds so that he can finish her off, & keep spamming attackers until you defeat the base before the rest of the threats spawn.

